            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR2b007a-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:38:38.039+09:00">除非是遇到姒履癸（夏桀）、子受辛（商纣）之类的暴君；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:38:58.217+09:00">     或除非是遇到子天乙（汤）、姬发（武）之类的仁君，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:39:23.606+09:00">人民归心</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:39:50.831+09:00">上天保佑，才可以改变。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:40:49.152+09:00">否则，君王和人民之间的名分，当永远保持，并且不惜为保持这种名分，牺牲自己的生命。</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
